--- Real fix diff: fast-jwt CVE-2023-48223, V0 (3.3.1) -> V1 (3.3.2) public-key-vs-HMAC classification ---
# Upstream commit 15a6e92c9adb39acde41a9b11cec0cbde8ad763b (nearform/fast-jwt,
# "Merge pull request from GHSA-c2ff-88x2-x9pg", 2023-11-20) — the fix that became
# npm fast-jwt@3.3.2: publicKeyPemMatcher changes from the string
# '-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----' (used with .includes()) to the anchored regex
# /^-----BEGIN( RSA)? PUBLIC KEY-----/ in src/crypto.js.
# Source: https://github.com/nearform/fast-jwt/commit/15a6e92.patch (fetched 2026-10-11).
# Cross-checked: hunks are identical to the diff of published npm fast-jwt@3.3.1 vs
# fast-jwt@3.3.2 src/crypto.js.
# The previous content of this file was a binary diff of .git/index (not a readable
# source patch); replaced 2026-10-11 — original kept in
# benchmark/replacements_2026-10-11/PCBV2-0108/patch_real.diff (see MANIFEST.md there).
# Everything below this header is the verbatim upstream `git format-patch` output.
From 15a6e92c9adb39acde41a9b11cec0cbde8ad763b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nils stolpe <nstolpe@users.noreply.github.com>
